  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/bb2a70dc5ed50984a23afa89456c5748dbecbbdf3e1d4c05f462799250af3be4.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Diện tích tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Áp dụng định lý côsin cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tsuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bán kính đường tròn ngoại tiếp tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tNửa chu vi tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>21</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"bl